":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-09-15T16:06:49Z","updated_at":"2017-09-15T16:06:49Z","body":"Ah, AmazonDrive my favorite. I'm guessing this is another one of the many eventual consistency issues ACD has that break some of the assumptions in the test, because this is enough to make the test pass for me:\r\n```\r\ndiff --git a/fs/operations_test.go b/fs/operations_test.go\r\nindex 1ac25457..7c75e6e0 100644\r\n--- a/fs/operations_test.go\r\n+++ b/fs/operations_test.go\r\n@@ -763,6 +763,8 @@ func TestRcat(t *testing.T) {\r\n        fs.Config.CheckSum = true\r\n        check()\r\n \r\n+       time.Sleep(10 * time.Second)\r\n+\r\n        fs.Config.CheckSum = false\r\n        check()\r\n }\r\n```\r\nIt's probably due to the test overwriting the file and the inconsistent replies make reasoning hard. I will implement a no-overwrites solution instead of the sleep, though.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/329826722/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"breunigs","id":307954,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzk1NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307954?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs","html_url":"https://github.com/breunigs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs/repos","events