pload is small (34 bytes), uploading instead of streaming\r\n2017/09/15 18:10:49 DEBUG : no_checksum_small_file_from_pipe: Sizes identical\r\n2017/09/15 18:10:49 DEBUG : amazon drive root 'rclone-test-yilinik1senexex5viniqon8': Target remote doesn't support streaming uploads, creating temporary local FS to spool file\r\n2017/09/15 18:10:49 DEBUG : no_checksum_big_file_from_pipe: Sizes identical\r\n2017/09/15 18:10:50 INFO  : no_checksum_big_file_from_pipe: Copied (new)\r\n--- PASS: TestRcat (23.05s)\r\n\toperations_test.go:170: Remote \"amazon drive root 'rclone-test-yilinik1senexex5viniqon8'\", Local \"Local file system at /tmp/rclone354959481\", Modify Window \"876000h0m0s\"\r\n\tfstest.go:265: Sleeping for 1s for list eventual consistency: 1/6\r\n\tfstest.go:268: Flushing the directory cache\r\n\tfstest.go:259: Sleeping for 6s just to make sure\r\n\toperations_test.go:170: Remote \"amazon drive root 'rclone-test-yilinik1senexex5viniqon8'\", Local \"Local file system at /tmp/rclone354959481\", Modify Window \"876000h0m0s\"\r\n\tfstest.go:265: Sleeping for 1s for list eventual consistency: 1/6\r\n\tfstest.go:268: Flushing the directory cache\r\n\tfstest.go:259: Sleeping for 6s just to make sure\r\nPASS\r\nok  \tgithub.com/ncw/rclone/fs\t24.708s\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rclone/rclone/issues/comments/329828214/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"breunigs","id":307954,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzk1NA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/307954?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs","html_url":"https://github.com/breunigs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/breunigs/gists